<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown ups Atmel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown ups Atmel.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown analyst Greg Mischou raised his rating on Atmel Corp to strong buy from buy, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst raised his 1997 earnings estimate slightly to $2.45 per share from $2.40 and established a 1998 estimate for $2.95 per share, the office said.</p>
<p>-- Mischou boosted his target price to $53 from $43.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
</text>
